{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44812","headline":"早春书情寄河南崔少府 · 清江","name":"早春书情寄河南崔少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春日春风至，阳和似不均。\n病身空益老，愁鬓不知春。\n宇宙成遗物，光阴促幻身。\n客游伤末路，心事向行人。\n道薄犹怀土，时难欲厌贫。\n微才如可寄，赤县有乡亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"清江","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44812.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44812","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}